  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 175 °C and butter a 20 cm springform tin well, sides included.",
    "Simmer the blueberries with 1 tsp honey for 5 minutes until they burst and thicken, then cool.",
    "Whisk the eggs into the yogurt until no streaks of yolk remain.",
    "Whisk in the honey, cornstarch, vanilla and lemon zest until pale and glossy.",
    "Pour into the tin in one continuous ribbon so no air gets trapped.",
    "Spoon three blobs of compote on top and drag a skewer through in loose S curves.",
    "Bake 45 minutes: the edges set and the centre still wobbles slightly.",
    "Cool on the counter, then chill for at least 4 hours. It firms up as it gets cold."
